  "duration_s": 417.89,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "老话说，地上文物看山西，要说中国哪里的老建筑最让人服气，山西绝对算得上一个这里的木头，扛过千年风雨，到今天依然站得笔直。可您知道山西那么多国宝古建，最不可思议的到底是哪一座吗？有人说是悬空寺挂在绝壁上一千五百年。有人说是佛光寺一千一百多年的唐代大殿，错，悬空寺连前寺都进不了，佛光寺也不是第一，真正排在榜首的那座，不用一根铁钉，近千年里挨了近两百发炮弹，还站在那儿。今天咱们就来盘点山西十大最不可思议的古代木结构建筑。话不多说，茶给您砌好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第十名，平遥镇国寺，万佛殿，山西，平遥。说起平遥，您想到的准是明清。古城可从古城往东北走十来公里。郝洞村里还藏着一座殿，公元九百六十三年盖的五代乱世的手艺，全国现存的五代木构，一共就三座，他占了一座。您站在殿前屋檐底下那圈斗拱大的像撑开的伞，比后来明清的斗拱粗壮好几倍。店里的良家一颗铁钉没用，全靠木头一榫一毛咬在一起，一千多年过去没散，这乱世里留下的奇迹，您说惊人不惊人。第九名，高平崇明寺中佛殿，山西晋城高平。这座殿是北宋开宝年间盖的，一千多年了，他藏着一门几乎失传的绝活，叫断粮造。您走进店里，一抬头，那根大梁是断开的，两节短木头在半空中对接。当年工匠手里凑不齐那么长的枕木，就琢磨出一个办法，让两段木头靠榫卯和杠杆的巧劲彼此咬住，再让斗拱和立柱一起分担重量。听着像要塌吧，可他这一段就是一千年风雪压着屋顶压着粮还在。别人是把木头接掌宋代的民间工匠，是把一根断梁接成了千年不倒的本事。您说这手艺算不算鬼斧神工？第八名，朔州崇福寺，弥陀殿，山西朔州，他是金代皇家下令修的大殿，面阔期间宽的像个大礼堂，您往店里一站，心里最先冒出来的念头准是柱子呢？原来，为了让礼佛的人有足够的地方站工匠大胆抽掉了殿内，整整八根承重柱，这叫减铸造头顶沉甸甸的屋顶。万军的重量全被分到了，四周的粮价，可都拱上八百多年。过去店里空空荡荡，屋顶稳稳当当，抽掉八根柱子，还敢盖期间的大殿。古人，这胆子大的包天心，似又细如发丝，八根柱子抽走，大殿，稳立八百多年。您说这力学琢磨的透不透？第七名，太原晋祠，圣母殿，山西太原，晋祠，您或许去过，可多数人只顾着看泉水，没留意殿前廊下那八根柱子，每根柱子上都盘着一条木雕。巨龙是北宋刻的将近一千年，是现存最早的一批木雕盘。这座殿还有个第一四周一圈回廊叫覆街周匝。现存最早的食物就是他最不可思议的是，店就坐在泉水边上，常年潮气裹着木头，本该早就烂了。可这八条龙到今天还怒目圆睁，张牙舞爪，像随时要从柱子上飞出去。一千年前刻在木头上的龙没烂在水汽里，您说神不神。第六名，芮城永乐宫三清殿山西运城芮城讲到这里，上级最重的一锤就砸下来了。这是元代的大殿七百多年呢公里近千平方米的壁画，诸神列队气势压人。可他最让人吃惊的不是壁画，是一次搬家。一九五九年，黄河、三门峡要修水库，永乐宫的老地方。要被淹了怎么办？工匠们把整座大殿一块一块拆开，编上号，拆成几千个榫卯构件，壁画也一块一块，小心切下来，一起运到二十公里外，再原样拼回去。一座七百岁的木头大殿，像搭积木一样，拆了又拼，您说这是什么样的手艺？千年的榫卯经得起剑也经得起拆，这才是真功夫。从第十到第六名，镇国寺的散状斗工撑过了五代乱世，崇明寺断了梁阙，千年不垮，崇福寺，抽掉八根柱子，屋顶纹丝不动。圣母殿木雕盘龙千年不动，圣乐宫，整座大殿拆成几千块，又拼了回去，可他们还不是最不可思议的。接下来第五道第一名更加绝妙，有一座楼阁，全凭悬空倒挂的柱子，把楼层挑在半空。有一座绝壁奇构，看似用细木撑着，骨子里却横插在岩石深处，可排在榜首的那座二十层楼高的纯木身躯，在狂风地震和两百发战争炮弹的洗礼下，硬是一点没他他是哪座，他凭什么排在大名鼎鼎的悬空寺？前面下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页就能看到点个关注，看看谁才是山西古代木结构建筑的巅峰神话。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 330,
      "end_ms": 1070,
      "text": "老话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1670,
      "end_ms": 3570,
      "text": "地上文物看山西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4430,
      "end_ms": 8189,
      "text": "要说中国哪里的老建筑最让人服气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8630,
      "end_ms": 12370,
      "text": "山西绝对算得上一个这里的木头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12630,
      "end_ms": 14170,
      "text": "扛过千年风雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 14450,
      "end_ms": 16730,
      "text": "到今天依然站得笔直。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17170,
      "end_ms": 20210,
      "text": "可您知道山西那么多国宝古建，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20890,
      "end_ms": 23670,
      "text": "最不可思议的到底是哪一座吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 24170,
      "end_ms": 28410,
      "text": "有人说是悬空寺挂在绝壁上一千五百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 28830,
      "end_ms": 33580,
      "text": "有人说是佛光寺一千一百多年的唐代大殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 33880,
      "end_ms": 34120,
      "text": "错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 34600,
      "end_ms": 37060,
      "text": "悬空寺连前寺都进不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 37600,
      "end_ms": 39380,
      "text": "佛光寺也不是第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 39740,
      "end_ms": 41960,
      "text": "真正排在榜首的那座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 42620,
      "end_ms": 44060,
      "text": "不用一根铁钉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 44840,
      "end_ms": 48000,
      "text": "近千年里挨了近两百发炮弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 48740,
      "end_ms": 49960,
      "text": "还站在那儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50480,
      "end_ms": 56100,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点山西十大最不可思议的古代木结构建筑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 56440,
      "end_ms": 57180,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 57580,
      "end_ms": 58720,
      "text": "茶给您砌好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 59040,
      "end_ms": 60915,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 61240,
      "end_ms": 62105,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 62430,
      "end_ms": 63335,
      "text": "第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 63740,
      "end_ms": 65040,
      "text": "平遥镇国寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65060,
      "end_ms": 65855,
      "text": "万佛殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66220,
      "end_ms": 66660,
      "text": "山西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 66720,
      "end_ms": 67275,
      "text": "平遥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 68060,
      "end_ms": 69045,
      "text": "说起平遥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 69460,
      "end_ms": 71280,
      "text": "您想到的准是明清。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 71280,
      "end_ms": 74785,
      "text": "古城可从古城往东北走十来公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 75230,
      "end_ms": 77215,
      "text": "郝洞村里还藏着一座殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 77950,
      "end_ms": 81765,
      "text": "公元九百六十三年盖的五代乱世的手艺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 82570,
      "end_ms": 84415,
      "text": "全国现存的五代木构，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 84700,
      "end_ms": 85735,
      "text": "一共就三座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 86200,
      "end_ms": 87165,
      "text": "他占了一座。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 87610,
      "end_ms": 92425,
      "text": "您站在殿前屋檐底下那圈斗拱大的像撑开的伞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 93010,
      "end_ms": 96055,
      "text": "比后来明清的斗拱粗壮好几倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 96910,
      "end_ms": 99435,
      "text": "店里的良家一颗铁钉没用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 100030,
      "end_ms": 102845,
      "text": "全靠木头一榫一毛咬在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 103500,
      "end_ms": 105885,
      "text": "一千多年过去没散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 106250,
      "end_ms": 108645,
      "text": "这乱世里留下的奇迹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 109070,
      "end_ms": 110545,
      "text": "您说惊人不惊人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 110940,
      "end_ms": 111775,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 112300,
      "end_ms": 114140,
      "text": "高平崇明寺中佛殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 114480,
      "end_ms": 115915,
      "text": "山西晋城高平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 116490,
      "end_ms": 119465,
      "text": "这座殿是北宋开宝年间盖的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 119760,
      "end_ms": 120815,
      "text": "一千多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 121440,
      "end_ms": 124215,
      "text": "他藏着一门几乎失传的绝活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 124790,
      "end_ms": 126075,
      "text": "叫断粮造。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 126550,
      "end_ms": 127530,
      "text": "您走进店里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 127530,
      "end_ms": 128215,
      "text": "一抬头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 128620,
      "end_ms": 130485,
      "text": "那根大梁是断开的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 131280,
      "end_ms": 134305,
      "text": "两节短木头在半空中对接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 134740,
      "end_ms": 137725,
      "text": "当年工匠手里凑不齐那么长的枕木，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 138280,
      "end_ms": 139855,
      "text": "就琢磨出一个办法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 140350,
      "end_ms": 145535,
      "text": "让两段木头靠榫卯和杠杆的巧劲彼此咬住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 146100,
      "end_ms": 149175,
      "text": "再让斗拱和立柱一起分担重量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 149570,
      "end_ms": 150755,
      "text": "听着像要塌吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 151210,
      "end_ms": 157785,
      "text": "可他这一段就是一千年风雪压着屋顶压着粮还在。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 158170,
      "end_ms": 161995,
      "text": "别人是把木头接掌宋代的民间工匠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 162420,
      "end_ms": 166035,
      "text": "是把一根断梁接成了千年不倒的本事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 166730,
      "end_ms": 169895,
      "text": "您说这手艺算不算鬼斧神工？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 170270,
      "end_ms": 171165,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 171620,
      "end_ms": 172920,
      "text": "朔州崇福寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 173020,
      "end_ms": 173735,
      "text": "弥陀殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 174090,
      "end_ms": 175195,
      "text": "山西朔州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 175940,
      "end_ms": 179035,
      "text": "他是金代皇家下令修的大殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 179710,
      "end_ms": 183005,
      "text": "面阔期间宽的像个大礼堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 183610,
      "end_ms": 184945,
      "text": "您往店里一站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 185450,
      "end_ms": 189555,
      "text": "心里最先冒出来的念头准是柱子呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 190020,
      "end_ms": 190380,
      "text": "原来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 190380,
      "end_ms": 195780,
      "text": "为了让礼佛的人有足够的地方站工匠大胆抽掉了殿内，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 195900,
      "end_ms": 197735,
      "text": "整整八根承重柱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 198250,
      "end_ms": 202075,
      "text": "这叫减铸造头顶沉甸甸的屋顶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 202850,
      "end_ms": 205820,
      "text": "万军的重量全被分到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 205820,
      "end_ms": 207045,
      "text": "四周的粮价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 207280,
      "end_ms": 209280,
      "text": "可都拱上八百多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 209280,
      "end_ms": 211140,
      "text": "过去店里空空荡荡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 211340,
      "end_ms": 212705,
      "text": "屋顶稳稳当当，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 213580,
      "end_ms": 214955,
      "text": "抽掉八根柱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 215270,
      "end_ms": 216895,
      "text": "还敢盖期间的大殿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 217360,
      "end_ms": 217760,
      "text": "古人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 217760,
      "end_ms": 219970,
      "text": "这胆子大的包天心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 220010,
      "end_ms": 221415,
      "text": "似又细如发丝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 221950,
      "end_ms": 223225,
      "text": "八根柱子抽走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 223610,
      "end_ms": 224030,
      "text": "大殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 224050,
      "end_ms": 225375,
      "text": "稳立八百多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 225850,
      "end_ms": 227755,
      "text": "您说这力学琢磨的透不透？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 228110,
      "end_ms": 228835,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 229490,
      "end_ms": 230570,
      "text": "太原晋祠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 230650,
      "end_ms": 231335,
      "text": "圣母殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 231880,
      "end_ms": 232825,
      "text": "山西太原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 233740,
      "end_ms": 234260,
      "text": "晋祠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 234320,
      "end_ms": 235485,
      "text": "您或许去过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 236030,
      "end_ms": 238175,
      "text": "可多数人只顾着看泉水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 238640,
      "end_ms": 241415,
      "text": "没留意殿前廊下那八根柱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 241890,
      "end_ms": 244970,
      "text": "每根柱子上都盘着一条木雕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 244990,
      "end_ms": 249085,
      "text": "巨龙是北宋刻的将近一千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 249610,
      "end_ms": 252410,
      "text": "是现存最早的一批木雕盘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 253160,
      "end_ms": 259195,
      "text": "这座殿还有个第一四周一圈回廊叫覆街周匝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 259880,
      "end_ms": 264865,
      "text": "现存最早的食物就是他最不可思议的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 265380,
      "end_ms": 267465,
      "text": "店就坐在泉水边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 268110,
      "end_ms": 270740,
      "text": "常年潮气裹着木头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 270740,
      "end_ms": 271995,
      "text": "本该早就烂了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 272370,
      "end_ms": 275115,
      "text": "可这八条龙到今天还怒目圆睁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 275690,
      "end_ms": 276635,
      "text": "张牙舞爪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 277160,
      "end_ms": 279855,
      "text": "像随时要从柱子上飞出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 280250,
      "end_ms": 284675,
      "text": "一千年前刻在木头上的龙没烂在水汽里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 285180,
      "end_ms": 286105,
      "text": "您说神不神。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 286460,
      "end_ms": 287295,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 287750,
      "end_ms": 293375,
      "text": "芮城永乐宫三清殿山西运城芮城讲到这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 293840,
      "end_ms": 296525,
      "text": "上级最重的一锤就砸下来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 297010,
      "end_ms": 302905,
      "text": "这是元代的大殿七百多年呢公里近千平方米的壁画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 303520,
      "end_ms": 306055,
      "text": "诸神列队气势压人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 306740,
      "end_ms": 309700,
      "text": "可他最让人吃惊的不是壁画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 309980,
      "end_ms": 311020,
      "text": "是一次搬家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 311440,
      "end_ms": 312520,
      "text": "一九五九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 313020,
      "end_ms": 315280,
      "text": "黄河、三门峡要修水库，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 316120,
      "end_ms": 317660,
      "text": "永乐宫的老地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 317660,
      "end_ms": 319500,
      "text": "要被淹了怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 319840,
      "end_ms": 323060,
      "text": "工匠们把整座大殿一块一块拆开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 323360,
      "end_ms": 324080,
      "text": "编上号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 324620,
      "end_ms": 326780,
      "text": "拆成几千个榫卯构件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 327360,
      "end_ms": 329060,
      "text": "壁画也一块一块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 329100,
      "end_ms": 330180,
      "text": "小心切下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 330740,
      "end_ms": 332820,
      "text": "一起运到二十公里外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 333160,
      "end_ms": 334680,
      "text": "再原样拼回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 335100,
      "end_ms": 337370,
      "text": "一座七百岁的木头大殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 337810,
      "end_ms": 339110,
      "text": "像搭积木一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 339150,
      "end_ms": 339890,
      "text": "拆了又拼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 340310,
      "end_ms": 342050,
      "text": "您说这是什么样的手艺？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 342850,
      "end_ms": 346650,
      "text": "千年的榫卯经得起剑也经得起拆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 346990,
      "end_ms": 348450,
      "text": "这才是真功夫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 348810,
      "end_ms": 350310,
      "text": "从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 350710,
      "end_ms": 354190,
      "text": "镇国寺的散状斗工撑过了五代乱世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 354790,
      "end_ms": 356290,
      "text": "崇明寺断了梁阙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 356510,
      "end_ms": 357310,
      "text": "千年不垮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 357910,
      "end_ms": 358630,
      "text": "崇福寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 358810,
      "end_ms": 360050,
      "text": "抽掉八根柱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 360170,
      "end_ms": 361310,
      "text": "屋顶纹丝不动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 361950,
      "end_ms": 364610,
      "text": "圣母殿木雕盘龙千年不动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 365230,
      "end_ms": 365930,
      "text": "圣乐宫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 365990,
      "end_ms": 367940,
      "text": "整座大殿拆成几千块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 367940,
      "end_ms": 368965,
      "text": "又拼了回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00145",
      "start_ms": 369580,
      "end_ms": 372225,
      "text": "可他们还不是最不可思议的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00146",
      "start_ms": 372580,
      "end_ms": 374935,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更加绝妙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00147",
      "start_ms": 375590,
      "end_ms": 376630,
      "text": "有一座楼阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00148",
      "start_ms": 376710,
      "end_ms": 378930,
      "text": "全凭悬空倒挂的柱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00149",
      "start_ms": 378950,
      "end_ms": 380555,
      "text": "把楼层挑在半空。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00150",
      "start_ms": 381290,
      "end_ms": 382930,
      "text": "有一座绝壁奇构，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00151",
      "start_ms": 382970,
      "end_ms": 384745,
      "text": "看似用细木撑着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00152",
      "start_ms": 385240,
      "end_ms": 387875,
      "text": "骨子里却横插在岩石深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00153",
      "start_ms": 388280,
      "end_ms": 392855,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那座二十层楼高的纯木身躯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00154",
      "start_ms": 393560,
      "end_ms": 397555,
      "text": "在狂风地震和两百发战争炮弹的洗礼下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00155",
      "start_ms": 397970,
      "end_ms": 400825,
      "text": "硬是一点没他他是哪座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00156",
      "start_ms": 401270,
      "end_ms": 404290,
      "text": "他凭什么排在大名鼎鼎的悬空寺？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00157",
      "start_ms": 404310,
      "end_ms": 407085,
      "text": "前面下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00158",
      "start_ms": 407980,
      "end_ms": 409165,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00159",
      "start_ms": 409410,
      "end_ms": 412515,
      "text": "进入主页就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cc091a347d058e1f_s00160",
      "start_ms": 413100,
      "end_ms": 417595,
      "text": "看看谁才是山西古代木结构建筑的巅峰神话。"
    }
  ],
